  "description": "Doctor DO diagnoses Windows Delivery Optimization on Intune-managed devices. The free DoctorDO PowerShell module checks a device's DO settings, download sources, peers, ports, proxies and Connected Cache, and writes an offline HTML or PDF report. The module is source-available under the PolyForm Shield license. A fleet console that runs in your own Azure, with per-site efficiency and fixes mapped to Intune settings, is in private preview.",
